            <ArticleTitle>Erratum to: Interaction of the signaling state analog and the apoprotein form of the orange carotenoid protein with the fluorescence recovery protein.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s11120-017-0445-0</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In Fig. 1a in the original article, the amino acid side chains were incorrectly labeled in the structure representation of the orange carotenoid protein (OCP). The corrected figure is printed in this erratum.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
